# Purpose: Identify generated inputs and preserve their required whitespace formatting.
# Pattern: Path-scoped Git attributes.
# Usage: Git checks authored whitespace while GitHub groups generated binding changes.
# Related: api/meca/v1, internal/serverapi/gen, webui/src/shared/api/gen, webui/patches/README.md.
internal/serverapi/gen/** linguist-generated=true
webui/src/shared/api/gen/** linguist-generated=true whitespace=-blank-at-eof
webui/patches/*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol
